The following runtime and builder logic ports Hugging Face Transformers v5.22.2
(https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/tree/v5.22.2):

- runtime/image_preprocess.cpp (sliced_grid, best_resize, refine_size and the crop
  layout of preprocess_image) follows MiniCPMV4_6ImageProcessor in
  src/transformers/models/minicpmv4_6/image_processing_minicpmv4_6.py;
- runtime/image_preprocess.cpp (nearest_position_ids) follows
  get_vision_nearest_position_ids and runtime/image_preprocess.cpp (block_order) follows
  get_vision_window_index in src/transformers/vision_utils.py;
- runtime/prompt.cpp (expand_images) follows MiniCPMV4_7Processor in
  src/transformers/models/minicpmv4_7/processing_minicpmv4_7.py, and runtime/prompt.cpp
  (group_frames, canvas_positions, canvas_coordinates) follows _group_visual_frames,
  get_rope_index and get_vision_position_ids of MiniCPMV4_7Model in
  src/transformers/models/minicpmv4_7/modeling_minicpmv4_7.py;
- vision.py and decoder.py express the computation of
  src/transformers/models/minicpmv4_7/modeling_minicpmv4_7.py and
  src/transformers/models/qwen3_5_moe/modeling_qwen3_5_moe.py as TensorRT networks.

